WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.480
Love!

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.480
You won't believe what I found! – What?

3
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.480
I managed to grab it right from under their noses. Ta-da!

4
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.480
What do you need a 48th perfume this year for?

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.480
It's not the 48th, it's my special one that I love most in the world, but this is a limited edition.

6
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.480
Limited edition? – Well, yes!

7
00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.480
You have a perfume-buying disease, Andjelka. You have perfumitis, or whatever it's called.

8
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.960
Of course, I need it, imagine how silly it would be not to have it in my collection.

9
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.560
Oh sure, how silly. – Well, it is.

10
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.000
You waste money on marketing tricks, on nonsense.

11
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.960
Do you know when you'll stop wasting money, Andje? When you start earning it, believe me.

12
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.720
You bought a wine fridge, you never used it once, we all know you drink beer!
